Source: libjq-xs-perl
Section: perl
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Inverse inc. <support@inverse.ca>
# No libjq-dev: the jq vendored in the upstream tarball is compiled in and
# linked statically, so the build needs only the C toolchain that
# debhelper-compat and perl-xs-dev already pull in.  Archive::Tar and
# Digest::SHA, used to unpack and verify that tarball, come with perl:native.
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13),
               libjson-pp-perl,
               perl-xs-dev,
               perl:native
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://metacpan.org/release/JQ-XS
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: libjq-xs-perl
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${perl:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         libjson-pp-perl
Description: Perl object-oriented wrapper for libjq
 JQ::XS provides a clean object-oriented wrapper around libjq, the C library
 behind the jq command-line JSON query language.
 .
 Features:
  * compile and execute jq filter programs;
  * process Perl data structures (hashes, arrays, numbers, strings);
  * process JSON text directly;
  * UTF-8 string support;
  * error handling through Perl exceptions;
  * multiple output values per input.
